  "case_id": "c45_candidate_and_neighbor_info_window_edges",
  "title": "The 24-hour window counts a delivery exactly 24 hours before and one at the receipt's own instant",
  "rules": ["lnk_01", "lnk_02", "lnk_04", "lnk_05"],
  "reasoning": [
    "Casey's Q2 answer (PR #66 comment 6968763406, item 2), as PR #67 words it in lnk_01: \"Both edges of the 24 hours count: a delivery exactly 24 hours before the receipt, and one at the receipt's own instant, are in the window, for candidates and for NeighborInfo reports alike\".",
    "The receipts come from c45-s (byte 80) at c45-g. c45-g heard by radio c45-ra (byte 97) at 22 10:10:00, c45-rc (byte 99) at 22 10:29:59 and c45-rb (byte 98) at 23 10:20:00. c45-g's own NeighborInfo reports: one at 22 10:40:00 listing c45-rd (byte 100), and one at 22 10:49:59 listing c45-re (byte 101). No other node in the case has a byte from 97 to 101.",
    "23 10:10:00, relay 97: c45-ra was heard exactly 24 hours before, so it is a candidate, the only one with 97. Both reports are in the window and neither lists 97: relayer c45-ra, link_source relay_node.",
    "23 10:20:00, relay 98: c45-rb was heard at the receipt's own instant, which counts as before: relayer c45-rb, link_source relay_node.",
    "23 10:30:00, relay 99: c45-rc was heard 24 hours and 1 second before, outside the window, and no report lists 99: dropped by lnk_01.",
    "23 10:40:00, relay 100: no candidate has 100. The report of 22 10:40:00, exactly 24 hours before, is in the window and lists one neighbour with 100, c45-rd: relayer c45-rd, link_source neighbor_info.",
    "23 10:50:00, relay 101: no candidate has 101. The report listing c45-re was sent 24 hours and 1 second before and the other report earlier still, so no report is in the window: dropped by lnk_01.",
    "Every c45-r node is stationary on c20 and c45-g on g16 (lnk_02), so the two drops are lnk_01's alone. The three resolved receipts pass lnk_05 at 2745.603 m and are counted; each relayer has 1 counted packet in the 10:00 hour, so three link-hours are dropped by lnk_04."
  ],
